<%# The bar a list is narrowed from: one card holding the search, the tag dropdown and the
    selects in a row that wraps. A GET back to the list's own path, so filtering stays on the
    page it was done from rather than sending the results somewhere else to be narrowed again.
    Which controls the bar carries is each list's own business, so the block is yielded the
    form builder and fills the row itself.
    locals:
      path: the list this filters, which is also where the form submits %>
<%= form_with url: path, method: :get, class: 'card bg-light mb-3' do |form| %>
  <div class="card-body p-2 d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2">
    <%= yield form %>
  </div>
<% end %>
